---
source: crates/example/src/app/cli_args.rs
expression: output
---
Stop the application.

Usage: example stop <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>  Identifier of the resource to stop.

Flags:
  -h, --help                   Print help

Global flags:
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>  Set the log level.
                               [possible values: error, warn, info, debug,
                               trace]
                               [env: EXAMPLE_LOG_LEVEL]
